{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-08_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-08","title":"Dusk","storyCode":"3-8","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"73d8e3941f8947d627945a93e2fc365f1fa8ed12941601485b8251f7e7f8d935","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh! They're still fighting back!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as we can push them back, victory will be ours!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Right now... we have no choice but to fight."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"These guys... are pretty tough!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Unless you want to die in vain right here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"You'd expect us to believe you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Very well. You've made your choice then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"In that place... No, in many places..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Another path?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"What... could we possibly do?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"And what could you accomplish?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Explosions?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"He's planning to surround us from multiple directions!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Our flank will collapse if we can't seize the initiative... Prepare to counterattack!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer! I'll cover you! Just kill them, and the battle will be over!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to go back... with all of you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to...!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"----------"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We don't have much time left!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Hoshiguma."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm ready."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Act carefully. Don't show the enemy any signs of weakness."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't give them an opening!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out, the enemy is charging forward!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Stay away from the enemy...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-that's..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... Doctor, what should I do..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"You know what you have to do, Amiya.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But I don't want to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry, Doctor... I..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"A-..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why did you become like this..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... I guess this was our fate all along."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! What are you doing? Hurry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en? I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"That's enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...to put an end to this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"There is one thing I must tell you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"From now on, you'd better treat all Infected the same way... ...as your enemies."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Life is unfair."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"If you want to hate someone, then hate me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D.! Attack!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L.G.D. Agent"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Ch'en","Hoshiguma"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Skullshatterer"]}]}
